## Decision-point retrieval (v{{PRODUCT_VERSION}})

The controller links `skills/opensocrates/references/decision/guide.en.md` and `skills/opensocrates/references/decision/guide.ko.md`.
Read routing metadata and complete selected locale-specific canonical references
at a materially changed judgment within the same request. Mechanical steps need
none. This is agent-directed in-turn lookup, not automatic observation of every
reasoning transition. A delivered reference or agent read assertion is not proof
of application or better output. No prompt, transcript or reasoning state is
persisted by this path. Existing native hook/fallback boundaries remain in force.

Use the generated file references in the active context. This package does not
provide the Python decision-session runtime. No new automatic hook is claimed.
